Subject: Share original frontend animation sampling and timeline advance

Upstream-base: bab83befb5d6a2fdff0b30d2ec4b59f7251a108d

Select original Bezier and share FE key/ring/time equations with a checked native
owner. Preserve scalar/vector sentinel and singleton differences, presentation
plus slide advance, strict endpoints and single loop subtraction. Native callers
validate ring ownership, key order, inputs and result casts; no menu handlers.

